tonight we hear from a 92 year old woman  whose car wasn't stolen but burglarized  leaving her without a way to get around  madison kimbrough joins us live with her  story tonight  yeah we're here near monterra meadows  retirement facility and that's where the  theft occurred at this parking lot you  can see behind me it happened sometime  last night and for marion demario who  still drives her truck to get around the  sentimental value behind the car is why  she gets so emotional thinking about the  whole ordeal  and i've taken care of it just like a  baby  i mean  the maintenance is always done and they  go over it with a fine tooth comb if it  needs anything 92 year old marion  demario has lived in las vegas for over  60 years and tuesday morning she woke up  to this i came down to go to breakfast  and i thought gee do i have a flat tire  i want to look and that's what i found  was all of my wheels were gone on all  four  marion immediately contacted management  at the retirement facility she lives at  but due to the lack of security cameras  they didn't have any leads marion then  called the police to file a report and  while they took down her information  they never made it out to look at the  burglarized truck demario says this  truck is so much more than just a mode  of transportation as it was a gift given  to her almost 30 years ago from her late  husband marion's daughter says this all  could have been avoided if the  retirement living community of monterra  meadows had fixed their facility's gate  to my understanding it has been  not functioning for over a month  and this is something especially in this  community with all the seniors this  should have been repaired the day of  that it didn't work properly because  this makes them all so vulnerable it's  terrible because how are they going to  feel safe  demario's family has set up a gofundme  page to help with the cost of replacing  the missing wheels and tires if you  would like to help marion we have a link  to that gofundme page up attached to  this story on our website reporting live  madison kimbrough live local now
 

